In Algorithm 1, when a matrix is complete and stored in the output file, the generation process continues with the backward function. Here, the last index of the matrix is used as the input. However, with the “learning from connectivity test”, the algorithm continues with the last entry of the first component. For example, in matrix B, the first component is \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
