MAYGEN always generates the same number of structures as MOLGEN. Times for Molgen were determined with the -noaromaticity flag to achieve comparability. PMG generates more structures in some cases due to different valences of S, P and N, which is why the per molecule run time is also given in milliseconds (ms)
